# EAS Build archive rules (this file lives at the git repo root).
# See https://expo.fyi/eas-build-archive
#
# IMPORTANT: when .easignore exists, EAS ignores every .gitignore file, so the
# mobile app's own ignore rules are repeated at the bottom of this file.
#
# The Expo project is univote-mobile/. The Laravel backend (univote-web/) is
# excluded because it contains a Windows junction (univote-web/public/storage)
# that EAS cannot recreate in its shallow clone while packing the upload:
#   EPERM: operation not permitted, symlink ... 'univote-web/public/storage'

# --- Backend (not part of the mobile build) ---
# Anchored, and without a trailing slash, so the directory itself is pruned
# (a trailing slash would only match its children).
/univote-web

# --- Repo root clutter ---
*.md
/check_avatars.php

# --- Mobile project (mirrors univote-mobile/.gitignore) ---
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
expo-env.d.ts
.env
.env.*
*.log
